<title>PERU: Peru's Cervesur 9-mo net off 70.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's Cervesur 9-mo net off 70.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 7.45 million soles vs 25.58 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 161.97 million soles vs 112.77 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania Cervecera del Sur del Peru SA is the country's third biggest brewery.</p>
<p>-- Renzo Pipoli, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
